ex:ActOfAccounting rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfAccounting rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). CCO 2.0 has no generic bookkeeping/record-keeping class; recording and reconciling transactions manipulates input ICEs into an updated record ICE, so it anchors under cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing), per the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE. Rejected cco:ont00000950 'Act of Maintenance' (modifies Material Artifacts, not records). Distinct from bpo:ActOfFinancialTransaction (which moves the money itself). Recurs in accounting categories (9.0; likely 8.0)." .
ex:ActOfAccounting rdfs:label "Act of Accounting" .
ex:ActOfAccounting rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 .
ex:ActOfAccounting skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing in which an Agent records, classifies, posts, or reconciles financial transactions and produces or updates a Descriptive Information Content Entity (such as a ledger, journal, or account record) that registers the organization's financial state." .

ex:ActOfAcquisition rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfAcquisition rdfs:comment "Local extension (D9). Rejected cco:ont00000950 'Act of Maintenance' (modifying Material Artifacts) and cco:ont00000402 'Act of Communication' (mere ICE transfer). Securing/obtaining a held entity anchors at the generic Planned Act. Expected to recur in procurement/asset-acquisition categories (4.0, 10.0)." .
ex:ActOfAcquisition rdfs:label "Act of Acquisition" .
ex:ActOfAcquisition rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfAcquisition skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent obtains from some authority or supplier an entity (such as an authorization, license, or resource) that the Agent did not previously hold." .

ex:ActOfAnalysis rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfAnalysis rdfs:comment "Local extension (D9). CCO 2.0 has no generic analysis class; analysis is information processing, so it is anchored under cco:ont00000366." .
ex:ActOfAnalysis rdfs:label "Act of Analysis" .
ex:ActOfAnalysis rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 .
ex:ActOfAnalysis skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing in which an Agent examines one or more input Information Content Entities and produces an Information Content Entity that represents an understanding of their subject matter." .

ex:ActOfDevelopment rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfDevelopment rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) because development spans both informational and material outputs (new technologies, software/hardware components, prototypes, delivery processes) and is broader than cco:ont00001359 (Act of Manufacturing, mass production) and cco:ont00000051 (Act of Construction, building to contract); a development act whose product is specifically a built/mass-produced material artifact should instead use those narrower CCO acts, attaching the material product via obo:BFO_0000057 (has participant), not has output (reserved for ICEs). Recurs across develop/build categories (2.0, 4.0, 8.0)." .
ex:ActOfDevelopment rdfs:label "Act of Development" .
ex:ActOfDevelopment rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfDevelopment skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent brings a novel product, service, solution, technology, component, prototype, or process from a specification or concept into an existent realized state." .

ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). Re-anchored from the bare cco:ont00000228 to cco:ont00000836 (Act of Financial Instrument Use): every subclass uses/transfers a Financial Instrument (money and cash are Financial Instruments in CCO -- cf. Portion of Cash cco:ont00000475 subClassOf 537), and CCO models settlements, loans, purchases, deposits, withdrawals and exchanges uniformly under 836. Rejected cco:ont00001334 'Act of Purchasing' and cco:ont00000389 'Act of Buying' (both acquire a good/service -- too narrow) and cco:ont00000366 'Act of Information Processing' (a payment moves a material/financial-instrument filler, not only an ICE). cco:ont00000228 co-asserted because 836 falls outside the S2 standalone-SHACL allowlist. Recurs in payment/treasury/trade categories (9.0)." .
ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction rdfs:label "Act of Financial Transaction" .
ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000836 .
ex:ActOfFinancialTransaction skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent transfers or uses money or a Financial Instrument to or from another Agent in settlement of an obligation, an investment, or an exchange." .

ex:ActOfFormulation rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfFormulation rdfs:comment "Local extension (D9). Anchored under cco:ont00000511 (Act of Planning) because formulating a strategy/mission/design is making a plan to achieve an objective; its output is a Directive ICE. Recurs across develop/define/compose-a-directive processes corpus-wide." .
ex:ActOfFormulation rdfs:label "Act of Formulation" .
ex:ActOfFormulation rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000511 .
ex:ActOfFormulation skos:definition "An Act of Planning in which an Agent composes and articulates a Directive Information Content Entity - such as a mission, strategy, objective, design, roadmap, or business model - that prescribes an organization's intended course of action." .

ex:ActOfImprovement rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfImprovement rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). Anchored under cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act): it alters an existing occurrent-type or system rather than merely processing information or composing a new plan. Distinct from bpo:ActOfImplementation (enacts a fixed directive). Rejected cco:ont00000950 'Act of Maintenance' (restores/preserves a Material Artifact's designed Qualities/Functions, whereas improvement raises performance of a process/system). Recurs in improve/reengineer/enhance/sustain processes (13.0)." .
ex:ActOfImprovement rdfs:label "Act of Improvement" .
ex:ActOfImprovement rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfImprovement skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent modifies an existing process, system, or capability with the intent of raising its performance, quality, or fitness against stated objectives." .

ex:ActOfMonitoring rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfMonitoring rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). CCO 2.0 has no generic monitoring/tracking class. Anchored under cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing) because monitoring ingests repeated observations (including electronic records, not only senses) and yields a descriptive status/deviation ICE -- the GOLDEN PRINCIPLE (descriptive output => information-processing genus) holds. Rejected cco:ont00000037 (Act of Observation: a single sense-based acquisition, too narrow -- monitoring also processes ICEs and is sustained); cco:ont00000636 (Act of Appraisal: renders a single bounded value/quality judgement rather than tracking status over time); and cco:ont00000345 (Act of Measuring: a single quantification against a standard at one time -- at most a method sub-step of the monitoring cycle; a node that is purely one quantification, e.g. Calculate performance measures, anchors to cco:ont00000345 directly, not here). Distinct from bpo:ActOfAnalysis (one-shot examination of a fixed input set) by its continuous, longitudinal character. A standing 'Manage/Monitor X' function with no natural end is an Organization Capability (cco:ont00000568) realized in such acts, not itself a process. Recurs corpus-wide (slices 3.0/4.0/5.0/6.0/8.0/9.0/10.0/11.0/12.0/13.0). Reconciled from 10 divergent slice restatements to one definition." .
ex:ActOfMonitoring rdfs:label "Act of Monitoring" .
ex:ActOfMonitoring rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 .
ex:ActOfMonitoring skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing in which an Agent repeatedly or continuously observes the state, progress, or performance of some process, system, or quantity over time and produces a Descriptive Information Content Entity that represents its tracked status against expected conditions, targets, or requirements." .

ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). CCO 2.0 has no Act-of-Establishment/Organization class (verified: no 'Act of Establish/Organiz/Constitut/Found' label in the closure). REJECTED bpo:ActOfFormulation (Act of Planning): formulating composes a Directive ICE, but establishing a committee primarily constitutes an independent continuant (the body) rather than authoring a directive; the responsibility-assignment directive is a downstream byproduct of seating the body, not the act's primary product. Anchored at the generic cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act). Recurs in 9.0." .
ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment rdfs:label "Act of Organizational Establishment" .
ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfOrganizationalEstablishment skos:definition "A Planned Act in which an Agent constitutes and seats an Organization or organizational body (such as a board, committee, or unit), bringing the body into existence and conferring its mandate." .

ex:ActOfRemuneration rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfRemuneration rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). Inlines the verified CCO leaf cco:ont00000449 (Act of Remuneration, subClassOf cco:ont00001334 Act of Purchasing subClassOf cco:ont00000836) for payroll rows whose APQC text is salary/compensation disbursement to employees -- a closer genus than bpo:ActOfFinancialTransaction. NOT used for payroll-TAX remittance to a government authority. cco:ont00000228 co-asserted because 449 is outside the standalone-SHACL S2 process-anchor allowlist." .
ex:ActOfRemuneration rdfs:label "Act of Remuneration" .
ex:ActOfRemuneration rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfRemuneration rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000449 .
ex:ActOfRemuneration skos:definition "An Act of Remuneration in which an Employer disburses a Financial Instrument (salary, wages, bonus, or other compensation) to an Employee for services performed." .

ex:ActOfReporting rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfReporting rdfs:comment "PROPOSE-EXT (D9). CCO 2.0 has no broad reporting class spanning compilation and assertion. Anchored under cco:ont00000379 (Act of Representative Communication), with cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act) co-anchored so standalone SHACL resolves the act chain: reporting transfers to recipients a descriptive account (report, statement, scorecard, filing) asserting an organization's condition or results. Pure submission of an already-prepared report may use the verified leaf cco:ont00000151 directly." .
ex:ActOfReporting rdfs:label "Act of Reporting" .
ex:ActOfReporting rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000228 .
ex:ActOfReporting rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000379 .
ex:ActOfReporting skos:definition "An Act of Representative Communication in which an Agent transfers to one or more recipients a Descriptive Information Content Entity (such as a report, statement, scorecard, or filing) that asserts, as true, a representation of an organization's condition or results." .

ex:ActOfSelection rdf:type owl:Class .
ex:ActOfSelection rdfs:comment "Local extension (D9). Anchored under cco:ont00000366 (Act of Information Processing): receives candidate-option ICEs and yields a decision ICE. Distinct from Act of Appraisal (judges without committing) and Act of Planning. NOTE: ratifying a single already-settled option is NOT selection (no candidate set) -- anchor such acts at cco:ont00000228 (Planned Act)." .
ex:ActOfSelection rdfs:label "Act of Selection" .
ex:ActOfSelection rdfs:subClassOf cco:ont00000366 .
ex:ActOfSelection skos:definition "An Act of Information Processing in which an Agent chooses one or more options from a set of candidates and produces a Directive Information Content Entity that prescribes the chosen option(s)." .

