ex:enablesProcess rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty .
ex:enablesProcess rdfs:comment "Capability -> process class whose execution it enables. Operational inverse of bpo:requiresCapability; BFO grounding is 'has realization' (a capability is realized in such processes). Used for authoring scope and wiring-coherence checks." .
